    "finalName": "",
    "description": "You can spend a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Point\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Point\">Force Point</a> to heal wounds by drawing life energy from up to three targeted creatures within 12 squares of you. Once per encounter, you can make a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Use_the_Force\" title=\"Use the Force\">Use the Force</a> check. If the check result equals or exceeds a target's <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Fortitude_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Fortitude Defense\">Fortitude Defense</a>, the target takes 1d6 points of <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force\">Force</a> damage per every <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Sith_Apprentice\" title=\"Sith Apprentice\">Sith Apprentice</a> and <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Sith_Lord\" title=\"Sith Lord\">Sith Lord</a> Class Level you possess.<br><br>You heal half the total damage dealt (cumulative from all targets). If the attack fails, the target takes half damage, and you heal that amount.",
